[OC]|cffffcc00Done:|r every Gnomeregan quest is handed in or abandoned; A Fine Mess, if you kept it, rides to Scooty in Booty Bay (chapter 31). In the route this run was chapter 24: when you reach it, its quest steps are already complete and only its Ironforge round is left (the level 30 trainer, the Balloo chain, the Explorers' hand-ins); chapter 25's Shoni step is done too. Go back to the chapter you left
